.TH "idevicedebug" 1
.SH "نام (NAME)"
idevicedebug \- Interact with the debugserver service of a device.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.B idevicedebug
[OPTIONS] COMMAND

.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"

Interact with the debug service of a device. Currently the only implemented
command is "run" and allows execution of developer apps and watch the
stdout/stderr of the process.

.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
.B \-u, \-\-udid UDID
target specific device by UDID.
.TP
.B \-n, \-\-network
connect to network device.
.TP
.B \-e, \-\-env NAME=VALUE
set environment variable NAME to VALUE.
.TP
.B \-d, \-\-debug
enable communication debugging.
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
prints usage information.
.TP
.B \-v, \-\-version
prints version information.

.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B run BUNDLEID [ARGS...]
run app with BUNDLEID and optional ARGS on device.

.SH "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
Martin Szulecki

.SH ON THE WEB
https://libimobiledevice.org

https://github.com/libimobiledevice/libimobiledevice
